Description: Client-side 'DataSHIELD' package that orchestrates the federated
    estimation of the average treatment effect (ATE) across multiple independent
    randomised controlled trials (RCTs), each held on a separate data server.
    Implements in a federated way the g-formula estimator from Khellaf, Bellet
    and Josse (2025) "Federated Causal Inference: Multi-Study ATE Estimation
    beyond Meta-Analysis" <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2410.16870>, including
    delta-method variance estimation and optional adjustment for study-specific
    intercept shifts.
